		(property "Note" "Battery-sense divider top half - 1M/1M gives a clean 2:1 ratio (BAT_RAW max ~3.3V -> ~1.65V, comfortable ADC headroom). High value keeps switched-on current ~1.65uA, and it's only connected during the brief active window via Q4."
			(at 281.94 78.74 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
