					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "Note" "Swapped 2026-08-24: TDK MLP2520S4R7ST0S1 (C383386) -> TDK TFM252012ALMA4R7MTAA (LCSC C404806). Two problems found checking XC9145 datasheet p.9 parts selection guide: (1) MLP2520S4R7ST0S1's only published rating is a THERMAL 1.0A (no Isat given), already below the XC9145's own ILIM typ=1.3A (datasheet p.14, Current Limit function). (2) TDK's own MLP2520 datasheet calls it 'non-magnetic shield type' requiring careful layout due to magnetic interference risk - the datasheet's own note *5 requires a shielded inductor, and all 6 listed candidates are shielded. TFM252012ALMA4R7MTAA: Isat max 1.9A / Itemp max 1.6A (real TDK datasheet, both above ILIM with margin), closed magnetic circuit (shielded). Same 2.5x2.0x1.2mm body as before. Footprint kept as Inductor_SMD:L_1008_2520Metric: TDK's own recommended land pattern is near-identical between old and new part (both A=2.3mm span; pad 0.40x2.70mm @ +-0.95mm for the old part vs 0.50x2.80mm @ +-0.90mm for the new one) and the generic KiCad footprint already in use is larger than both (pad 1.25x2.20mm @ +-1.075mm) - more copper, not less, so no new pad-compatibility risk. See chat log."
			(at 349.25 26.67 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
