		(property "LCSC" "C2653639"
			(at 303.53 36.83 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "Note" "Ideal diode, voltage-comparison based (NOT current-inferred like LM66100 which was rejected): turns off when VOUT>VDD by 26mV typ (datasheet Principle of Operation). Blocks backfeed from breakout J5/Pico-probe 3V3 (tied to VDD_NRF on the breakout, confirmed) into BAT_RAW/CR2032. Placed AFTER Q1: VDD=Q1.D side (renamed VDD_PROT), OUT=shared VDD_NRF net. Q1 alone does NOT block this - its channel stays ON whenever the battery is present regardless of D-side voltage (Vgs set purely by S=BAT_RAW vs G=GND), so it only protects against reversed/absent battery, not backfeed while battery is present. EN tied to VDD_PROT (datasheet: connect EN to VDD for full temp range). ICA leakage 10nA typ/50nA max @VOUT=4V. Verified against primary TI/ADI/Maxim datasheet text, not summaries. See decision log."
			(at 303.53 36.83 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
