		(property "Note" "Local bypass at U2 (SHT40). SENSOR_3V3 decoupling. The rail is switched by Q3 and had NO local capacitance at all - every bypass/bulk cap sits upstream on VOUT_3V3. ROHM's BH1750 application circuit specifies 0.1uF on VCC and Sensirion lists decoupling as mandatory for the SHT4x, and the rail is now re-charged from zero on every measurement cycle."
			(at 334.01 250.19 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
