				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "Note" "Reverted to SHT40 on 2026-08-24. Identical DFN-4 1.5x1.5mm package, identical pinout, identical I2C address 0x44 - no footprint or layout impact. Trade-off accepted: +-3%RH instead of +-2%RH at the 0-10% and 90-100%RH extremes (both parts are +-1.8%RH across 20-80%RH). In exchange it is stocked at LCSC (C2909890) whereas SHT41-AD1B-R2 (C7461861) was not listed and had to be sourced separately at Digikey. Footprint deliberately kept as DFN-4_L1.5-W1.5-P0.8-TL-EP: the EP-less footprint referenced by the original easyeda2kicad SHT40 symbol does not exist in myco_host.pretty. See decision log 2.9."
			(at 321.31 240.03 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
