		(property "Note" "Battery-sense divider switch: S=BAT_RAW D=BAT_SENSE_TOP G=P1_13_SENSOR_EN (shared with Q3). Keeps the R11/R12 divider disconnected from BAT_RAW except during the brief active-measurement window, avoiding a continuous leakage path now that the free internal-VDD SAADC battery trick no longer works (VDD_NRF is regulated 3.3V post-merge, not the raw cell)."
